# CI toolchain (test, lint, type check, mutation, MCP inspector), hash-pinned
# in ci.txt so every `pip install` in .github/workflows is pinned (OpenSSF
# Scorecard Pinned-Dependencies). The package itself installs with
# `--no-deps` on top of this, so its runtime dependencies are listed here
# with the ranges pyproject.toml declares.
# Regenerate:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.11 \
#     requirements/ci.in -o requirements/ci.txt
# Runtime (pyproject [tool.poetry.dependencies] plus the `online` extra).
